@startuml
!include style.puml
title PAVEX — Vận đơn, thực thi và sự cố\nHiện trạng · không tạo các entity RouteLeg / Proof chưa tồn tại
class Shipment {
  trackingCode : String
  status : ShipmentStatus
  lifecycleStatus : ShipmentLifecycleStatus
  routeRevision : Integer
}
class ShipmentAddressSnapshot <<value object>> {
  contactName : String
  contactPhone : String
  addressLine : String
}
class Parcel {
  code : String
  status : ParcelStatus
  actualWeightKg : Decimal
  custodyType : ParcelCustodyType
}
class ShipmentEvent {
  code : String
  occurredAt : Instant
}
class DeliveryAttempt {
  attemptNumber : Integer
  outcome : DeliveryAttemptOutcome
  failureReason : DeliveryFailureReason [0..1]
  proofMethod : DeliveryProofMethod [0..1]
  evidenceReference : String [0..1]
}
class "OperationalAssignment\n(Operations)" as Assignment {
  code : String
  sequence : Integer
  type : OperationalAssignmentType
  status : OperationalAssignmentStatus
}
class ShipmentCase {
  caseNumber : String
  type : ShipmentCaseType
  status : ShipmentCaseStatus
}
class ShipmentCaseEvent {
  code : String
  occurredAt : Instant
}
class ShipmentExceptionRequest {
  kind : RETURN / FORWARD / CANCELLATION
  status : ShipmentExceptionRequestStatus
}
class ShipmentWeightAdjustment {
  oldActualWeightKg : Decimal
  newActualWeightKg : Decimal
  reviewCompleted : Boolean
}
Shipment "1" *-- "1" ShipmentAddressSnapshot : sender
Shipment "1" *-- "1" ShipmentAddressSnapshot : recipient
Shipment "1" *-- "1..*" Parcel
Shipment "1" *-- "0..*" ShipmentEvent
Parcel "0..1" -- "0..*" ShipmentEvent : có thể liên quan
Parcel "1" -- "0..*" DeliveryAttempt
Shipment "1" -- "0..*" Assignment : {ordered by sequence}
Shipment "0..1" -- "0..*" ShipmentCase
Parcel "0..1" -- "0..*" ShipmentCase
ShipmentCase "1" *-- "0..*" ShipmentCaseEvent
Shipment "1" -- "0..*" ShipmentExceptionRequest
Parcel "1" -- "0..*" ShipmentWeightAdjustment
legend bottom
  UNIDENTIFIED_PARCEL có thể chưa liên kết vận đơn/kiện.
  Khi có parcel: parcel phải thuộc shipment tương ứng.
  Mỗi case thuộc 1 hub; quan hệ hub lược để dễ đọc.
  ────────────────────────────────
  PICKUP, ORIGIN_HUB_HANDLING, LINE_HAUL,
  TRANSIT_HUB_HANDLING, DESTINATION_HUB_HANDLING,
  LAST_MILE_DELIVERY. Không phải subclass hierarchy.
  routeLegId tham chiếu chặng đã giữ chỗ từ Network.
endlegend
@enduml
